{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Alchemickal</strong></i> is a roguelite twin-stick shooter where frantic action collides with elemental mayhem. Step into the shoes of an everyday alchemist who\u2019s in for <i>way</i> more than he signed up for.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Mix and Match</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/extras/0a86d7a1901986594f92205d8acafd61.poster.avif?t=1759113942\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/extras/0a86d7a1901986594f92205d8acafd61.webm?t=1759113942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/extras/0a86d7a1901986594f92205d8acafd61.mp4?t=1759113942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your jury-rigged tech to imbue your weapons with <strong>chemickals</strong>, granting elemental properties to your attacks. Shock foes with chain lightning, blind them to sow friendly fire, or coat them in flammable tar for a cascading explosion. Mix effects together to your heart's content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Know Your Enemy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/extras/35cd5a4987d16f03d672ab9f402e93bb.poster.avif?t=1759113942\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/extras/35cd5a4987d16f03d672ab9f402e93bb.webm?t=1759113942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/extras/35cd5a4987d16f03d672ab9f402e93bb.mp4?t=1759113942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies come with distinct quirks that shape every encounter: some bleed, others rust. Some can be tricked into attacking their own kin, others can have their powers sealed. Learn their tricks, exploit their weaknesses, and survive another floor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Freedom of Expression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/extras/1bad4805aa52ebefb4b55d3e526870aa.poster.avif?t=1759113942\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/extras/1bad4805aa52ebefb4b55d3e526870aa.webm?t=1759113942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/extras/1bad4805aa52ebefb4b55d3e526870aa.mp4?t=1759113942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon has a unique upgrade tree, while an odd shop between worlds tempts you with bizarre buffs. Each run twists your arsenal into something new: sometimes ingenious, sometimes disastrous, always explosive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced twin-stick combat that rewards quick thinking and improvisation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep alchemy system where chemickal mixtures unlock specialized effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies defined by both faction traits and elemental affinities for layered encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable weapons with branching upgrade paths that shape playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permadeath: every run starts from the beginning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated dungeons packed with hazards, ambushes, and other fun surprises.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3107030?t=1759113942","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759113942","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/d96149762c4629c78465067f7f3fedf121391d02/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759113942","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/d96149762c4629c78465067f7f3fedf121391d02/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759113942","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Alchemickal</strong></i> is a roguelite twin-stick shooter where frantic action collides with elemental mayhem. Step into the shoes of an everyday alchemist who\u2019s in for <i>way</i> more than he signed up for.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Mix and Match</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/extras/0a86d7a1901986594f92205d8acafd61.poster.avif?t=1759113942\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/extras/0a86d7a1901986594f92205d8acafd61.webm?t=1759113942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/extras/0a86d7a1901986594f92205d8acafd61.mp4?t=1759113942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your jury-rigged tech to imbue your weapons with <strong>chemickals</strong>, granting elemental properties to your attacks. Shock foes with chain lightning, blind them to sow friendly fire, or coat them in flammable tar for a cascading explosion. Mix effects together to your heart's content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Know Your Enemy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/extras/35cd5a4987d16f03d672ab9f402e93bb.poster.avif?t=1759113942\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/extras/35cd5a4987d16f03d672ab9f402e93bb.webm?t=1759113942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/extras/35cd5a4987d16f03d672ab9f402e93bb.mp4?t=1759113942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies come with distinct quirks that shape every encounter: some bleed, others rust. Some can be tricked into attacking their own kin, others can have their powers sealed. Learn their tricks, exploit their weaknesses, and survive another floor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Freedom of Expression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/extras/1bad4805aa52ebefb4b55d3e526870aa.poster.avif?t=1759113942\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/extras/1bad4805aa52ebefb4b55d3e526870aa.webm?t=1759113942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/extras/1bad4805aa52ebefb4b55d3e526870aa.mp4?t=1759113942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon has a unique upgrade tree, while an odd shop between worlds tempts you with bizarre buffs. Each run twists your arsenal into something new: sometimes ingenious, sometimes disastrous, always explosive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced twin-stick combat that rewards quick thinking and improvisation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep alchemy system where chemickal mixtures unlock specialized effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies defined by both faction traits and elemental affinities for layered encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable weapons with branching upgrade paths that shape playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permadeath: every run starts from the beginning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated dungeons packed with hazards, ambushes, and other fun surprises.</p></li></ul>","developers":["rodbot"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107030/2966dc7bb63a53e6e2b7f0c2d6f8bd731c180d6b/header.jpg?t=1759113942","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS, Ubuntu 20.04, or equivalent 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4460 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</stro